{"seq":6,"slug":"operating-system","title":"操作系统","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system","rating":{"composite":3.64,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":2.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"操作系统-简介\">操作系统 简介</h1><p>操作系统是计算机系统中最核心的系统软件，它负责管理硬件资源、提供用户接口，并为应用程序的运行提供基础环境。从个人电脑到服务器集群，从手机到嵌入式设备，操作系统无处不在。深入理解操作系统的原理，对于编写高性能程序、排查系统级问题以及设计分布式架构都至关重要。</p>\n<p>本手册面向计算机科学专业的学生、准备系统工程师面试的求职者，以及希望深入理解底层机制的软件开发者。无论你的目标是通过考试还是提升工程实践能力，这里都能为你提供清晰且系统的知识框架。</p>\n<p>全书将覆盖以下核心主题：进程管理与调度算法、内存管理与虚拟内存机制、文件系统的设计与实现、I/O 系统与设备管理、死锁检测与预防策略、系统安全与权限控制，以及现代操作系统（如 Linux）的内核架构分析。通过循序渐进的学习，你将建立起对计算机底层运作机制的全面理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"processes-and-threads","title":"进程与线程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/processes-and-threads","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"process-model","title":"进程概念与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/processes-and-threads/process-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thread-model","title":"线程模型与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/processes-and-threads/thread-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scheduling-algorithms","title":"CPU 调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/processes-and-threads/scheduling-algorithms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ipc","title":"管道信号共享内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/processes-and-threads/ipc"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"内存管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/memory-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-memory","title":"虚拟内存与分页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/memory-management/virtual-memory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-allocation","title":"内存分配与回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/m